 id="S4.p6.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="S4.p6.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{q+1}^{\circ}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{q+1}^{\circ}</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to a semiproper colouring of <math id="S4.p6.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="S4.p6.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> proper colours and one ‘free’ colour.</p>
