<p id="S4.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S4.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> be a positive integer.
For reals <math id="S4.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda^{(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\leq i\leq q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\leq i\leq q</annotation></semantics></math>, define</p>
